### Prerequisites
Make sure you've added [Wix Multilingual](https://support.wix.com/en/article/wix-multilingual-an-overview) to your site and enabled [Velo by Wix](https://support.wix.com/en/article/about-velo-by-wix).

### Step-by-Step Instructions

#### Step 1 | Add a Multi-State Box in your site's main language version
1. [Go to your editor](https://manage.wix.com/account/site-selector/?actionUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.wix.com%2Feditor%2F%7BmetaSiteId%7D%3FeditorSessionId%3D%7Besi%7D%26).
2. Click **Add** on the left side of your editor.
3. Click **Box**.
4. Click **Multi-State Boxes**.
5. Drag the **Blank** multi-state box to the relevant location on your page.
6. Add elements to the box and design it as you wish.

#### Step 2 | Change the current state's name
1. Select your multi-state box.
2. Click **Manage States**.
3. Click the **More Actions** icon next to the current state's name.
4. Select **Edit ID**.
5. Type "default" in the text box and click **Done**.

#### Step 3 | Duplicate the state and rename it
1. Select your multi-state box.
2. Click **Manage States**.
3. Click the **More Actions** icon next to the current state's name.
4. Select **Duplicate**.
5. Click the **More Actions** icon next to the duplicate state.
6. Select **Edit ID**.
7. Type "RTL" in the text box and click **Done**.

#### Step 4 | Adjust your box in the secondary language
1. Click the **Switch languages** drop-down menu at the top of the editor.
2. Select the RTL language you want to edit.
3. Click the multi-state box dropdown and select RTL.
4. Select the element in the box that you want to translate:
   - **Text:** Click **Edit Translation** or **Auto-translate** to translate the text. Then, click the **Change text direction** icon in the **Text Settings** panel to switch the text direction.
   - **Images:** Click **Edit Translation**, then click **Change** to choose a different image for the RTL version of your site.
5. Copy the following code snippet below and paste it in the **Page Code Tab** in your editor.

```javascript
import wixWindow from 'wix-window';
const RTLLangs = ['he','ar','fa'];
$w.onReady(function () {
 let lang = wixWindow.multilingual.currentLanguage;
 //based on RTL
 /////////////////////////////////////
 if(RTLLangs.includes(lang)){
 $w('#statebox8').changeState('RTL');
 }
 //based on exact match or default:
 /////////////////////////////////////
 let states = $w('#statebox8').states;
 let foundStates = states.filter((state)=>{state.id === lang});
 if(foundStates.length>0){
 $w('#statebox8').changeState(foundStates[0]);
 }
 else{
 $w('#statebox8').changeState('default');
 }
});
```

6. Click **Preview** to test your multi-state box.
7. Publish your site when you are ready to make the changes go live.
